WEBVTT

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:12.606
Kikou wa nori no warui

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.349
Watashi ga sanka suru

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:20.120
Hisabisa no doraibu de minna hai tenshon

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.384
Hisabisa no doraibu de minna hai tenshon

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:25.254
Kare mo kuru no

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:28.855
Myaku ga nakutomo

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:32.596
Zettai ikimasu tomo

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:38.637
Sugoi sugoi pokaa faisu dato shitara

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:41.775
Aru yo nante

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:45.845
Umi wa hiyake suru kara, yama ni shiyou tte

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:48.814
Umi wa hiyake suru kara, yama ni shiyou tte

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:53.953
Koo-to no kisetsu nanoni kanchigai shitiru

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:58.390
Koo-to no kisetsu nanoni kanchigai shitiru

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:02.629
Doushite nano?

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:06.599
Konna ureshikute

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:14.404
Chigiresouna hodo warate iru noni

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:22.949
Kare no senaka mite wa mune tsumaru

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:30.913
Taenai egao no usu no naka de

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:36.988
Episode 8
Go Love

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:40.800
This was cheap, but the color
comes out really nicely.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.135
I just think it's pretty!

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:43.570
Maybe I should buy one too.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:46.471
Next time we should go there together.
It's right by the C-line subway.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.243
Hello, Kate.

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:51.077
Hello.

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:52.846
I did have my bangs cut.

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:53.880
Really?

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.582
I was warned by Jessica.

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:57.812
I think, like that, they shouldn't be a problem.

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:59.952
I'm going to have mine cut on Sunday.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:02.884
Okay, I'll make sure to let Jessica know.

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:04.884
Thank you.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.662
I think she noticed your manicure, don't you?

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:10.830
That would suck.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.798
For something like that, you know?

00:02:17.704 --> 00:02:18.830
Do I pass?

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.197
You haven't even put anything on them,
have you?

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:25.603
Huh, it looks like they're doing some work on it.

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:28.645
Well, that thing's in rough shape.
They're painting it.

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:30.748
Oh, I see.

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:34.579
This island is just going to get
prettier and prettier.

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:37.986
Yeah, I wonder if that's thanks to our school?

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:39.092
Huh?

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:41.788
Well, this place does have a lot of money.

00:02:43.062 --> 00:02:46.533
Me, I really studied hard.

00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:51.436
I needed to come as a recommended student
so that I could have my fees reduced.

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:54.130
Because I could never afford such high fees.

00:02:54.874 --> 00:02:57.809
Though I thought things were really
strict when I started here,

00:02:58.244 --> 00:02:59.979
I realized that as long as one works hard,

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:06.407
there are no problems, no bad people,
and that it's really safe.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:07.887
Yeah...

00:03:08.121 --> 00:03:13.491
That's why I thought everything that
Lula was saying had to be a lie.

00:03:14.027 --> 00:03:15.628
Why would I believe it?

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:20.258
But I sure feel relieved now that she
said we can get our lives back.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.569
It's all so crazy.

00:03:22.569 --> 00:03:24.230
I'm relieved too.

00:03:24.604 --> 00:03:26.663
I mean, they've got our actual bodies.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.067
I got really worried when my body
got so cold all of a sudden

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:31.144
and my heart started racing.

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:38.607
But now, it looks like we can get our bodies back
if we stay tough and do what we need to do.

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:41.086
I wonder if everyone feels the same way?

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:42.778
I bet they do.

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:47.187
But it seems even scarier now.

00:03:47.594 --> 00:03:48.754
Why's that?

00:03:49.362 --> 00:03:52.991
Up until now I'd been doing nothing
but crying and running away.

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:55.893
But as soon as I understood
what I needed to do,

00:03:56.636 --> 00:03:58.204
I realized I am the worst of us all.

00:03:58.204 --> 00:04:00.907
That's not true. I mean, look at me.

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:06.277
Me, I'm not very athletic.
I'd be the first one that they'd get.

00:04:06.913 --> 00:04:08.574
I can't fight the way you all can.

00:04:09.449 --> 00:04:13.010
But you've started running, haven't you?

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.811
Yeah, and doing sit-ups.

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:17.147
How many?

00:04:18.358 --> 00:04:19.552
Five...

00:04:21.527 --> 00:04:25.930
Hey, the kind where you raise
your legs are hard.

00:04:26.165 --> 00:04:27.533
Maybe I'll start doing them too.

00:04:27.533 --> 00:04:28.500
Sure!

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:33.205
Let's do it.
Together, let's get our bodies back.

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:34.829
Yeah!

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:37.043
How is it?

00:04:37.043 --> 00:04:38.203
Good!

00:04:38.778 --> 00:04:40.246
Rose, you like raspberries, don't you?

00:04:40.246 --> 00:04:40.647
Yeah!

00:04:40.647 --> 00:04:41.247
We might put on a little weight,
Yeah!

00:04:41.247 --> 00:04:42.148
We might put on a little weight,

00:04:42.148 --> 00:04:43.445
but it can't hurt to eat 'em every now and then.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.018
Right...

00:04:45.018 --> 00:04:47.009
And they say sweet things
can get rid of tiredness.

00:04:47.387 --> 00:04:49.022
Rose, are you lacking in sleep recently?

00:04:49.022 --> 00:04:50.657
Huh? You can tell?

00:04:50.657 --> 00:04:52.215
Of course! You're my close friend.

00:04:52.525 --> 00:04:56.427
Close friend... That's right!

00:04:57.297 --> 00:04:58.491
I can tell.

00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:01.162
What's up with you recently?

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:02.727
Well...

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:05.571
Don't keep secrets from me.

00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:08.900
I... I'm doing sit-ups.

00:05:09.309 --> 00:05:11.106
Huh? Sit-ups?

00:05:11.311 --> 00:05:14.576
Yeah, five... Ten of them!

00:05:15.348 --> 00:05:17.475
Really? Kate?

00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:20.350
Members of Grace have to be role models.

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:23.923
And if they're hanging out with
problem students, well...

00:05:23.923 --> 00:05:27.026
Yeah, and that one certainly has
her problems, doesn't she?

00:05:27.026 --> 00:05:28.127
Yes!

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:32.120
But if something good comes out of
their hanging out together,

00:05:32.565 --> 00:05:33.827
it should be fine.

00:05:35.068 --> 00:05:36.899
Grace's job isn't just handling problems.

00:05:37.337 --> 00:05:40.864
It's also not to cause them, right?

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:43.276
Let me treat you to something!

00:05:43.276 --> 00:05:44.711
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

00:05:44.711 --> 00:05:45.611
But I'll treat!

00:05:45.611 --> 00:05:46.942
No, it's fine!

00:05:48.181 --> 00:05:52.185
If spending time with Kate,
leads them to change in a good way...

00:05:52.185 --> 00:05:53.914
You expect that to happen?

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.961
What do you think of this store?

00:06:01.961 --> 00:06:03.996
It seems like it's for adults.

00:06:03.996 --> 00:06:05.486
That's not what I mean.

00:06:06.366 --> 00:06:09.035
Hey, this is nice!

00:06:09.035 --> 00:06:12.405
Huh?! What are you going to do with
girly underwear like that?

00:06:12.405 --> 00:06:16.142
You can't cut corners just because
it's hidden. Right, Rachel?

00:06:16.142 --> 00:06:17.610
Huh? Oh, yeah...

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:20.880
Maybe it's that you have someone
you wouldn't hide it from!

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:23.280
No way! That's so slutty!

00:06:23.783 --> 00:06:25.910
Someone you wouldn't hide it from!

00:06:26.319 --> 00:06:27.387
Hey, look at this...

00:06:27.387 --> 00:06:28.945
Hey, you! Settle down a little!

00:06:35.128 --> 00:06:38.029
Wow, look at those!

00:06:38.297 --> 00:06:39.665
It looks like they'd make good weapons.

00:06:39.665 --> 00:06:40.299
Weapons?

00:06:40.299 --> 00:06:40.800
Oh! Well...
Weapons?

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:41.789
Oh! Well...

00:06:43.169 --> 00:06:45.505
No doubt! If there was some
jerk you couldn't stand

00:06:45.505 --> 00:06:47.273
one good kick to the crotch with those
would certainly do the job!

00:06:47.273 --> 00:06:48.708
What are you guys talking about?!

00:06:48.708 --> 00:06:50.042
Look at this one!

00:06:50.042 --> 00:06:51.644
Oh, listen to you, Vanessa!

00:06:51.644 --> 00:06:53.880
That isn't funny!

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:56.178
I didn't know you're into that kind of stuff!

00:07:08.161 --> 00:07:09.492
Welcome home.

00:07:09.729 --> 00:07:11.128
Hi...

00:07:13.599 --> 00:07:16.534
I'm just asking her to give me a break
on the three months of rent I owe.

00:07:17.136 --> 00:07:19.832
I mean, who'd want to live in a
hole like this anyway?

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:27.206
And she wants it all within the week?

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:30.007
Get real... What, does she want me to steal it?!

00:07:35.788 --> 00:07:37.756
Huh? What the...

00:07:41.294 --> 00:07:42.784
No...

00:07:49.268 --> 00:07:50.496
Huh?!

00:07:55.308 --> 00:07:56.866
That's Lise's...

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:00.040
The assistant principal told me to take care of it.

00:08:00.379 --> 00:08:01.573
Why?

00:08:01.914 --> 00:08:03.677
Why? How should I know?

00:08:12.925 --> 00:08:16.762
We can go back.

00:08:16.762 --> 00:08:20.323
We fight our enemy, and we go back.

00:08:21.734 --> 00:08:24.635
Go back...

00:08:26.072 --> 00:08:31.908
Even if I do something fun,
it's doesn't feel the same.

00:08:32.278 --> 00:08:35.873
Well, I feel better just knowing that there is the
possibility of getting our lives back.

00:08:36.782 --> 00:08:39.148
Kate, it must be nice being part of Grace.

00:08:39.952 --> 00:08:40.920
Why's that?

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.722
I mean if there's someone you don't like,

00:08:42.722 --> 00:08:43.923
you can just keep handing them tickets.

00:08:43.923 --> 00:08:45.686
That must help to get rid of stress.

00:08:46.659 --> 00:08:48.388
Just don't give me one, okay?

00:08:48.728 --> 00:08:52.061
You think giving out tickets is fun?

00:08:53.399 --> 00:08:55.668
After finding out that going back is possible,

00:08:55.668 --> 00:08:57.863
I've started to have doubts about a lot of things.

00:08:58.104 --> 00:08:59.765
What do mean, doubts?

00:09:00.172 --> 00:09:04.438
Such as what it is I enjoy
and what is it that's been fun.

00:09:04.744 --> 00:09:08.840
It's all good. Just by being in Grace,
your status is way up there.

00:09:09.582 --> 00:09:11.484
It's proof that you're an elite student.

00:09:11.484 --> 00:09:16.820
Yeah, my mom and dad were both happy when
they found out that I had been chosen.

00:09:16.989 --> 00:09:18.491
Well, so it's all good, right?

00:09:18.491 --> 00:09:21.227
But you hate Grace, don't you?

00:09:21.227 --> 00:09:24.864
Well, they can be annoying.
But I'm not referring to you.

00:09:24.864 --> 00:09:25.831
Sorry I'm late.

00:09:25.831 --> 00:09:26.999
You're late.

00:09:26.999 --> 00:09:29.092
Sorry, sorry. I had to get ready.

00:09:29.435 --> 00:09:30.595
What's that?

00:09:30.903 --> 00:09:32.165
A secret weapon.

00:09:40.313 --> 00:09:43.578
If you had a secret weapon
why not use it right away?!

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:47.219
You have to use it last.
Otherwise, it's not a secret weapon.

00:09:49.655 --> 00:09:51.891
Claire, a phone?

00:09:51.891 --> 00:09:54.724
This... Well, my service was cut off.

00:09:55.027 --> 00:09:57.222
The only use it is to me now is as a weapon.

00:09:57.463 --> 00:09:59.799
Heels work better.

00:09:59.799 --> 00:10:01.601
Heels? Yeah, I should buy some.

00:10:01.601 --> 00:10:03.536
Yeah, I need to think of something too.

00:10:03.536 --> 00:10:05.629
Why? All you ever do is just run away.

00:10:05.972 --> 00:10:08.174
Claire, what are you going
to do about a phone?

00:10:08.174 --> 00:10:11.177
Well, I'd better make enough money
to get a cell phone at least.

00:10:11.177 --> 00:10:12.178
What about a part-time job?

00:10:12.178 --> 00:10:13.279
Presently searching.

00:10:13.279 --> 00:10:14.541
Are you going to be all right?

00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:19.745
One probably couldn't say he
made the right decision,

00:10:20.353 --> 00:10:25.086
but the truth is that for some,
this planted seeds for the future.

00:10:25.958 --> 00:10:27.693
Whenever I think about his last days,

00:10:27.693 --> 00:10:30.218
I am reminded of the William Blake poem.

00:10:31.263 --> 00:10:35.757
"Go love without the help of any thing on earth."

00:10:36.235 --> 00:10:39.398
"...without the help of any thing on earth."

00:10:40.172 --> 00:10:43.369
Go love?

00:10:57.089 --> 00:10:58.190
And then, after that...

00:10:58.190 --> 00:10:59.191
Yeah?
And then, after that...

00:10:59.191 --> 00:10:59.885
And then, after that...

00:11:00.192 --> 00:11:01.250
Look!

00:11:01.861 --> 00:11:03.162
It's so pretty!

00:11:03.162 --> 00:11:05.398
I got up early yesterday because
I got a phone call.

00:11:05.398 --> 00:11:06.499
Really?

00:11:06.499 --> 00:11:07.989
And also, I've got...

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.602
I'm really getting sick of it.

00:11:09.602 --> 00:11:14.540
It's so obvious that Kate is sucking up to Paula.

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:17.343
It's so fake the way that she's in and
out of the student council room.

00:11:17.343 --> 00:11:20.379
Yeah, after pushing all the dirty work
off to Jessica all this time...

00:11:20.379 --> 00:11:22.715
I don't mind, but what Kate's
way of doing things is...

00:11:22.715 --> 00:11:24.046
Hey!

00:11:25.051 --> 00:11:26.484
Are you talking to us?

00:11:26.952 --> 00:11:30.723
Sucking up to someone...
Pushing things off onto others...

00:11:30.723 --> 00:11:32.158
Kate is not that type of person!

00:11:32.158 --> 00:11:33.259
Rose...
Kate is not that type of person!

00:11:33.259 --> 00:11:35.895
You... You've been spending a lot of time
with Kate lately, haven't you?

00:11:35.895 --> 00:11:36.562
Has she?

00:11:36.562 --> 00:11:36.962
A habitual truant, aren't we?
Has she?

00:11:36.962 --> 00:11:37.797
A habitual truant, aren't we?

00:11:37.797 --> 00:11:41.067
That's got nothing to do with it!
Don't talk bad about Kate!

00:11:41.067 --> 00:11:43.202
Write your name and student number here!

00:11:43.202 --> 00:11:46.605
Why?! I was only saying that you're
misunderstanding Kate!

00:11:46.605 --> 00:11:48.274
What do you think you know about Grace?

00:11:48.274 --> 00:11:50.071
What do you think you know
about what Kate's dealing...

00:11:50.643 --> 00:11:53.279
One's personal life getting in the way of their
duties as a member of Grace is a problem.

00:11:53.279 --> 00:11:54.313
Hey, Rose.

00:11:54.313 --> 00:11:55.214
Rachel...

00:11:55.214 --> 00:11:56.215
What are you doing?

00:11:56.215 --> 00:11:58.284
They were talking about Kate!

00:11:58.284 --> 00:11:59.285
Are you one of their friends?

00:11:59.285 --> 00:12:01.187
Knock it off. Let's go.

00:12:01.187 --> 00:12:02.421
You wait just one second!

00:12:02.421 --> 00:12:04.924
We're not doing anything that
deserves a ticket, are we?

00:12:04.924 --> 00:12:05.691
Rachel...

00:12:05.691 --> 00:12:06.192
You...
Rachel...

00:12:06.192 --> 00:12:06.749
You...

00:12:07.259 --> 00:12:09.061
Kate's friends are all delinquents,
aren't they?

00:12:09.061 --> 00:12:10.358
What the hell is going on here?

00:12:14.433 --> 00:12:15.501
What?

00:12:15.501 --> 00:12:16.602
Isn't that going to be too sweet?

00:12:16.602 --> 00:12:17.864
No, otherwise it's too bitter.

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:20.261
Then why don't you get something else?

00:12:21.741 --> 00:12:23.042
You don't add any?

00:12:23.042 --> 00:12:24.942
Nope, I like it black.

00:12:25.311 --> 00:12:26.573
Really?

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.248
You know, it's strange.

00:12:29.248 --> 00:12:30.282
What is?

00:12:30.282 --> 00:12:34.480
I've never imagined us having
coffee together like this.

00:12:35.354 --> 00:12:39.848
Yeah, I never would have considered
hanging out with someone like you.

00:12:41.527 --> 00:12:44.928
Unlike Kate, I thought you'd
be just like gossip had it.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:45.931
What?!

00:12:45.931 --> 00:12:50.129
Don't get mad. I still don't think much of it.

00:12:53.839 --> 00:12:57.376
Without a doubt, someone as stubborn
as you will survive to the end.

00:12:57.376 --> 00:12:58.210
Really?!

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.507
It's not meant to be a compliment.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.780
This is fun!

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.285
I hope we don't have to go tonight.

00:13:06.285 --> 00:13:07.453
Yeah...

00:13:07.453 --> 00:13:09.421
Since it's our special night...

00:13:09.655 --> 00:13:11.157
We're always together.

00:13:11.157 --> 00:13:13.853
No, this is different,
different than the other times.

00:13:14.193 --> 00:13:15.683
This makes me really happy.

00:13:19.098 --> 00:13:20.633
Why don't you come in and have tea?

00:13:20.633 --> 00:13:22.191
We should go soon!

00:13:23.102 --> 00:13:27.373
I... I can do anything.
I'm fine with early mornings too.

00:13:27.373 --> 00:13:28.607
What about school?

00:13:28.607 --> 00:13:32.236
It's fine! And I've got a car
so I can go wherever I need to.

00:13:34.013 --> 00:13:36.048
But...

00:13:36.048 --> 00:13:37.383
I'll work hard!

00:13:37.383 --> 00:13:40.648
We can't hire anyone who doesn't
have proper identification.

00:13:41.754 --> 00:13:44.848
My phone may be out of service,
but my address and all that is correct.

00:13:48.561 --> 00:13:49.653
Huh?

00:13:52.665 --> 00:13:53.732
What?

00:13:53.732 --> 00:13:54.892
Uh, nothing...

00:13:55.134 --> 00:13:57.870
What? By staring at me like that you
can tell what kind of person I am?

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:59.531
Just seeing what you look like.

00:14:01.874 --> 00:14:03.102
Well then, have a good look!

00:14:03.309 --> 00:14:05.110
If that's how you measure up a person,
look all you want!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:05.811
Hey, wait...
If that's how you measure up a person,
look all you want!

00:14:05.811 --> 00:14:06.412
Hey, wait...

00:14:06.412 --> 00:14:09.711
Easy! Stop! People are going
to think something!

00:14:12.518 --> 00:14:14.509
You'd think I could at least get
milk money out of this.

00:14:17.656 --> 00:14:18.714
Jeez...

00:14:29.134 --> 00:14:31.193
There's nothing good about it.

00:14:42.381 --> 00:14:43.609
Welcome home.

00:14:44.683 --> 00:14:45.809
Hi?

00:14:46.552 --> 00:14:49.488
Stretch! Stretch!

00:14:49.488 --> 00:14:52.324
I think it's colder in your room
than it is outside.

00:14:52.324 --> 00:14:54.026
Who decided on this?

00:14:54.026 --> 00:14:55.027
Me.

00:14:55.027 --> 00:14:56.028
Why at my place?

00:14:56.028 --> 00:15:00.431
Because we weren't able to get a hold of you.
You have a stew pot?

00:15:00.833 --> 00:15:01.993
A stew pot?

00:15:03.335 --> 00:15:04.734
Huh? This?

00:15:07.673 --> 00:15:08.874
Let's see...

00:15:08.874 --> 00:15:10.171
Should I go buy one?

00:15:10.376 --> 00:15:13.641
They have them at the 99 cent shop!
Though they are kind of small.

00:15:13.879 --> 00:15:15.073
Gas...

00:15:15.381 --> 00:15:16.849
My range won't work.

00:15:16.849 --> 00:15:18.584
Was that turned off too?

00:15:18.584 --> 00:15:19.718
I still have water at least.

00:15:19.718 --> 00:15:20.844
Well, great...

00:15:21.754 --> 00:15:24.023
What are we going to do?
You want to eat this raw?

00:15:24.023 --> 00:15:25.157
It'll be fine.

00:15:25.157 --> 00:15:26.681
Kate, what are you doing?!

00:15:26.926 --> 00:15:28.294
If you don't tear off pieces by hand,

00:15:28.294 --> 00:15:29.662
it loses all of its vitamins!

00:15:29.662 --> 00:15:30.890
Really?

00:15:31.196 --> 00:15:33.132
Rachel, it's going to go down the drain!

00:15:33.132 --> 00:15:34.133
I don't want to break a nail!

00:15:34.133 --> 00:15:35.634
You do it like this!

00:15:35.634 --> 00:15:37.836
I'm finished. You do it!

00:15:37.836 --> 00:15:39.405
You get the canned stuff ready then!

00:15:39.405 --> 00:15:40.739
Claire!

00:15:40.739 --> 00:15:43.342
We can't eat any of this stuff
if we don't cook it.

00:15:43.342 --> 00:15:45.708
Well, usually people have a stove they can use.

00:15:48.914 --> 00:15:50.541
It's a good thing we bought that.

00:15:51.183 --> 00:15:52.651
That's the first time.

00:15:52.651 --> 00:15:53.552
Huh?

00:15:53.552 --> 00:15:56.077
That anyone has ever made a meal for me here.

00:15:57.423 --> 00:16:00.119
Well, this kind of thing was a first for me too.

00:16:00.659 --> 00:16:01.626
What about with Lise?

00:16:03.495 --> 00:16:06.487
There were so many more things that I should
have tried to learn about, you know.

00:16:07.599 --> 00:16:11.865
I'm finally able to remember what kind of life
awaits me, if I can go back to it.

00:16:12.671 --> 00:16:15.799
Here I am desperately hoping
to live again, to go back,

00:16:17.109 --> 00:16:21.068
but now I see that there isn't anything
that great about that world anyway.

00:16:21.914 --> 00:16:25.617
But I've started to think that it's
fine if, when we go back,

00:16:25.617 --> 00:16:27.676
we don't go back to the exact same thing.

00:16:27.886 --> 00:16:28.887
Huh?

00:16:28.887 --> 00:16:32.220
I can't find a part-time job, so as always I'm broke.

00:16:33.025 --> 00:16:35.220
But this is at least better than having nothing.

00:16:35.728 --> 00:16:37.923
I suppose you wouldn't come and
visit me if I were dead?

00:16:40.532 --> 00:16:44.837
Hey, you two! Quit slacking off
or you don't get as much!

00:16:44.837 --> 00:16:45.704
Uh-oh!

00:16:45.704 --> 00:16:46.693
Coming!

00:16:48.173 --> 00:16:49.508
It's raw!

00:16:49.508 --> 00:16:50.943
Well, there's nothing we can do about it.

00:16:50.943 --> 00:16:52.644
And we don't have anything but salt.

00:16:52.644 --> 00:16:54.146
Hey! This is really good!

00:16:54.146 --> 00:16:57.616
Really?! The way you tear it affects the taste!

00:16:57.616 --> 00:17:01.450
Jeez, it's been so long since I just
munched on a carrot this way.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:02.721
It's good to eat one like that every now and then!

00:17:02.721 --> 00:17:04.189
It's good to eat one like that more
than every now and then!

00:17:04.189 --> 00:17:05.124
You're starting to piss me off!

00:17:05.124 --> 00:17:07.026
Vegetables are expensive, so it's not
like I can buy them all the time.

00:17:07.026 --> 00:17:09.859
I know! They're expensive lately!

00:17:10.529 --> 00:17:11.864
This is better than I would have expected too.

00:17:11.864 --> 00:17:12.831
Really?

00:17:14.366 --> 00:17:15.467
Yuck...

00:17:15.467 --> 00:17:21.407
Stop that! When you eat good food,
you have to say that it's good!

00:17:21.407 --> 00:17:23.898
Words are like raw food.

00:17:24.109 --> 00:17:26.509
If you don't use them right away, they rot!

00:17:27.046 --> 00:17:29.048
And what do you do when you just can't eat it?

00:17:29.048 --> 00:17:30.572
You ask for God's forgiveness.

00:17:30.783 --> 00:17:32.045
God please forgive me!

00:17:33.252 --> 00:17:34.981
Hey! That's not a garbage can!

00:17:35.287 --> 00:17:38.051
Well, I can't eat this! Claire can't either!

00:17:39.992 --> 00:17:40.856
Yum...

00:17:41.226 --> 00:17:42.861
This is good, you want to try it?

00:17:42.861 --> 00:17:45.659
I don't trust your taste.
I don't need it, I'll eat this.

00:17:45.898 --> 00:17:47.666
You're so spoiled!

00:17:47.666 --> 00:17:49.133
Well, it's just her taste.

00:17:50.903 --> 00:17:52.564
You will eat that!

00:17:53.405 --> 00:17:55.007
Why don't we just give this to that cat?

00:17:55.007 --> 00:17:56.565
That's good stuff!

00:17:59.978 --> 00:18:01.814
This isn't too bad at all.

00:18:01.814 --> 00:18:02.414
Yeah!

00:18:02.414 --> 00:18:02.881
We should do this again.
Yeah!

00:18:02.881 --> 00:18:03.515
We should do this again.

00:18:03.515 --> 00:18:06.318
Want to come to my place?
I'll make a lot of stuff!

00:18:06.318 --> 00:18:08.854
Let's do it! Next time's set for Rose's place.

00:18:08.854 --> 00:18:11.423
Having a meal like this, it's really nice.

00:18:11.423 --> 00:18:12.481
It is!

00:18:16.762 --> 00:18:31.632
Aa kono hibiki dake anata ni todokeba
If just this sound can reach you

00:18:32.644 --> 00:18:41.575
Togirezu omoi wa tsutawaru
I'll convey my thoughts to you without cease

00:18:43.188 --> 00:18:52.256
Sono kotoba niwa mou
Those words only perplex me

00:18:54.533 --> 00:19:09.278
Madowasareru dake hikari ga miezuni mayouno
I am lost without any light

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:23.460
Hibiki dake hirotte mezamete
So gather those sounds and open your eyes

00:19:25.297 --> 00:19:38.301
Nagare wa mou mae wo terasu
The flow will light the path before you

00:19:42.481 --> 00:19:57.658
Aa fukaku soko made hateru koto mo naku
Deep to the very bottom, nothing has an end

00:19:58.363 --> 00:20:07.738
Motomete tsukushite todomeru
I desire, I use up, I keep from going on

00:20:09.975 --> 00:20:21.284
Kae no nai kimochi wo sutezu ni
Holding on to this one unchanging feeling

00:20:23.722 --> 00:20:36.328
Torimodoshite kumo wo sora wo
I take back the clouds and the sky

00:20:37.369 --> 00:20:42.975
Kami no koe hakanaku chittemo
Even if God's voice were to

00:20:42.975 --> 00:20:48.709
Kami no koe hakanaku chittemo
Dissipate into nothingness

00:20:51.049 --> 00:21:04.452
Mite itai no mizu wo umi wo
I want to see the water, the sea

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:12.828
Be careful, okay?

00:21:14.406 --> 00:21:16.806
No summoning today, huh?

00:21:16.942 --> 00:21:18.877
Yeah, guess not.

00:21:18.877 --> 00:21:21.402
Yeah, I was thinking the same thing.

00:21:21.713 --> 00:21:25.774
Ditto. Well, see you all tomorrow.

00:21:28.453 --> 00:21:30.555
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:21:30.555 --> 00:21:32.853
One, two, everybody go!

00:21:40.966 --> 00:21:43.235
Toki wa kita, ima da, sou sa mada da!

00:21:43.235 --> 00:21:45.837
Kikkake wa itsu no me mo omae no namida

00:21:45.837 --> 00:21:47.939
Hakari urarete tebanasu mainichi ni

00:21:47.939 --> 00:21:50.142
lyake sasu nara hayaku tobe takaku

00:21:50.142 --> 00:21:51.710
Kinou no shippai? Kankei nee!

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:53.845
Asu e no fuan zenzen? Kankei nee!

00:21:53.845 --> 00:21:55.981
Itsumo taisetsu nanowa kono shunkan

00:21:55.981 --> 00:21:58.575
Dakara it goes up to the top, top, top, top

00:22:07.092 --> 00:22:08.827
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:08.827 --> 00:22:10.228
Tsudoe doushi yo mada minu

00:22:10.228 --> 00:22:11.296
Yume ga samenu nara

00:22:11.296 --> 00:22:13.065
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:13.065 --> 00:22:14.933
So don't care, babe!

00:22:14.933 --> 00:22:18.570
Sono wake wa kikanai kara

00:22:18.570 --> 00:22:22.808
Bokura ga kimi wo mamoru kara

00:22:22.808 --> 00:22:25.444
Kirawaremono de iisa

00:22:25.444 --> 00:22:30.015
Warawaretatte shinjita michi wo susume

00:22:30.015 --> 00:22:33.051
Warawaretatte shinjita michi wo susume

00:22:33.051 --> 00:22:35.654
Kimi no sono namida wa

00:22:35.654 --> 00:22:39.925
Sekai ni futatsu to nai takaramono sa

00:22:39.925 --> 00:22:42.694
Kakusanai you ni todoku you ni tada utau yo

00:22:42.694 --> 00:22:49.835
Kakusanai you ni todoku you ni tada utau yo

00:22:49.835 --> 00:22:52.070
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:54.172
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:22:54.172 --> 00:22:56.402
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:23:00.746 --> 00:23:03.271
What is it that they want?

00:23:04.516 --> 00:23:06.575
What is it that they want to protect?

00:23:07.886 --> 00:23:09.786
The new girls open their eyes,

00:23:10.322 --> 00:23:10.555
Episode #9
Awakening

00:23:10.555 --> 00:23:12.424
Episode #9
Awakening
and everything begins to turn to madness.

00:23:12.424 --> 00:23:14.449
